---
import coverCuento from '../home/img/cover-cuento.webp?url';
---

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden pt-14 pb-12 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-16">
  <!-- Radial glow, top-right -->
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(60%_50%_at_85%_20%,rgba(100,170,210,0.10),transparent_70%)]"
  ></div>

  <!-- Hint of arena from below -->
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 -z-10 h-1/2 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,_rgba(250,222,170,0.06),_transparent_75%)]"
  ></div>

  <!-- Floating bubble cluster -->
  <svg
    class="anim-float-soft pointer-events-none absolute top-24 right-[10%] -z-10 hidden h-10 w-10 text-celeste/25 md:block"
    viewBox="0 0 40 40"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.4"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14" />
    <circle cx="14" cy="15" r="2.5" />
  </svg>
  <svg
    class="anim-drift pointer-events-none absolute top-44 right-[20%] -z-10 hidden h-6 w-6 text-arena/35 md:block"
    viewBox="0 0 40 40"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.4"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14" />
  </svg>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-16">
      <div class="md:col-span-7">
        <!-- Eyebrow -->
        <div class="reveal flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-arena sm:w-16"></span>
          <span class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.4em] text-arena uppercase sm:text-sm">
            Sobre el cuento
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Headline -->
        <h1 class="reveal reveal-delay-1 mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,7.5vw,5rem)] leading-[0.95] tracking-tight text-caparol">
          Todo lo que hay
          <span class="block">
            detrás de
            <span class="relative inline-block hand-underline text-arena">
              SLPH
            </span>
          </span>
        </h1>

        <!-- Lead -->
        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2 mt-8 max-w-2xl font-display text-xl leading-tight text-celeste sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl">
          El cuento, la autora y las imágenes del camino.
          <span class="block mt-2 text-caparol/85">Tres puertas para asomarte al mismo mar.</span>
        </p>

        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-3 mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-caparol/85 sm:text-lg">
          <em class="not-italic text-arena">Si los peces hablaran…</em> empezó
          como musical en 2016 y se convirtió en libro ilustrado, programa
          educativo y comunidad. Aquí puedes leer un fragmento, conocer a
          Sandra Santa Cruz y recorrer la galería de todo lo vivido.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Book cover with stickers -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 md:col-span-5">
        <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-sm">
          <!-- Decorative ring -->
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="anim-sway absolute -inset-4 -z-10 rounded-[2rem] border-2 border-dashed border-arena/30 sm:-inset-6"
          ></div>

          <div class="polaroid tilt-r1 transition duration-500 hover:rotate-0">
            <img
              src={coverCuento}
              alt="Portada del libro Si los peces hablaran"
              class="block h-auto w-full"
              loading="eager"
              decoding="async"
              fetchpriority="high"
            />
            <p class="absolute bottom-2 left-0 right-0 text-center font-hand text-3xl leading-none text-azul sm:text-4xl">
              ¡bucea!
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Sand sticker -->
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="absolute -left-4 -top-4 flex h-20 w-20 -rotate-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-arena font-display text-azul shadow-xl sm:-left-6 sm:-top-6 sm:h-24 sm:w-24"
          >
            <span class="text-center text-xs leading-tight sm:text-sm">
              desde<br/><span class="text-xl sm:text-2xl">2016</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
